          "In front of the porch JG: 'if supp ulci → I flash; if ulci enemy ADC → cleanse'.",
          "Going to the side: 'if the opponent dashes at me → my E side, R at the end'.",
          "Mid wave: 'if enemy mid is roaming → push and echo to top'.",
          "Keep 2-3 if-thens in your head, not 20."
